# 🛰️ Ground Station Telemetry Dashboard

An interactive real-time spacecraft telemetry replay engine, rule-based health inspector, and machine learning anomaly detector built with Python. Designed as a **Proof of Concept (POC)** inspired by ground control operations in aerospace systems.

