## ✨ Core Functionalities

- **Telemetry Replay Engine**: Simulates live time-series frame ingestion from orbital missions.
- **Rule-Based Safety Inspection**: Monitors critical flight thresholds for battery voltage and system thermal levels.
- **AI Anomaly Detection**: Employs an `IsolationForest` model to detect subtle multi-variable telemetry deviations.
- **3D Trajectory Visualization**: Plots state-space vehicle dynamics in dynamic 3D representations.
- **Incident Report Export**: Generates instant CSV logs of mission anomalies.

